window.products.push({"id":878045,"name":"Laresar Cordless Vacuum Cleaner with Charging Station, 400W/33Kpa Stick Vacuum Cleaner with Dual Display, Handheld Vacuum Cleaner with Dust Sensor, Va","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h4rNQtIZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【🏆Automatically Adjust Suction】With an upgraded ultra-quiet 400 W motor, Elite 4 can deliver a strong suction power of up to 33 kpa. With a built-in sensor chip, the vacuum cleaner can instantly adjust the suction power according to the detected particle size in auto mode to achieve the best cleaning effect with the lowest loss. 【🏆Upgraded Wall-mounted Charging Station】No annoying unplugging and unplugging the charger, just put the cordless vacuum back on the wall mount after each use for automatic charging. (4 hours charging, 45 minutes in auto mode, 15 minutes in highest mode). Unlike most cordless vacuums, the Elite 4 can stand on its own for greater convenience. 【🏆Intelligent Dual Screen】Abandoning the traditional single-button operation, Elite 4's dual touch screen makes it easier to adjust your vacuum cleaner's working mode. With a comprehensive intelligent protection mechanism, the control panel lights up a red alarm when the vacuum cleaner is abnormal. Ergonomically designed widened handle makes cleaning easier. 【🏆Reject Flying Dust】Unlike most single-hole separators on the market, the centrifugal force of the 6-hole cyclone separator used inside Elite 4 is greatly enhanced, and the cyclone has a stronger effect of separating dust. The 5-layer filtration system filters step by step, which can not only prevent dust from entering the engine, prolong the service life of the vacuum cleaner, but more importantly, keep the indoor air clean. 【🏆Perfectly Clean Pet Hair】The new Roller Brush features a combination of soft and hard bristles that are best for removing debris and deeply embedded dirt such as cat litter, dog food crumbs and pet hair. Definitely a must-have for homes with kids and pets. In addition, the widened 9.5” floor brush head of Elite 4 can shorten the cleaning time, allowing you to have more time to enjoy life. 💝No Worry About After-sales, we offer a 36-Month customer service and accessories replacement service. Any concerns, we are always here.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h4rNQtIZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laresar","source_asin":"B0BX9RKYBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX9RKYBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX9RKYBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
