window.products.push({"id":878198,"name":"KLARSTEIN Mega Jerky Automatic Food Dehydrator - 650W, 8 Gallon, Metal Housing, 8 Chrome-Plated Shelves, 4 x Grates, 4 x Parallel Grates, Temperature:","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QIsKWxcVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DELICIOUS AND HEALTHY: KLARSTEIN Mega Jerky Food Dehydrator helps you to make delicious and healthy snacks yourself. You can easily make dried delicacies from the comfort of your own kitchen for on the go, to eat while training, or just for easy evening nibbling. POWERFUL PERFORMANCE: The powerful Klarstein Mega Jerky automatic dehydrator dries fruits, vegetables, meat, and other foods in record time. As a result, you can easily produce delicious, long-lasting snacks and ingredients in no time at all, making it one of the best dehydrators for food. PROPER TEMPERATURE: Whether you are making vitamin-rich dried fruit such as apple or banana chips, healthy veggies such as dried tomatoes, beetroot chips or crispy beans or even spiced strips of dried meat - the Mega Jerky has the right temperature every time for you. HOT AIR SYSTEM: The 650-Watt stainless steel heating element delivers temperatures of 95 to 176 ° F, which are evenly distributed inside over 8 drying levels of 15 x 10 inches in size thanks to the internal convector with HotAir Circulation System, making it the complete jerky dehydrator EASY CLEANING: The Mega Jerky food dehydrator has a timer, programmable in 30-minute increments, ensuring the correct duration of the drying process. Cleaning the dehydrator is completely simple: The chrome metal racks can be rinsed without any problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QIsKWxcVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KLARSTEIN","source_asin":"B083DZ24GF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878198","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083DZ24GF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083DZ24GF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":878199,"name":"Art Deco Flapper Color by Vintage Apple Collection, 18x18-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jADDu8p0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a woman holding a bottle of perfume. These posters got their start in the late 1800s when brands hired artists and illustrators to create their ads and announcements for various products such as chocolates, alcohol, soap, or cigarettes. This was the time when the development of mass printing emerged and this new technology allowed for low-cost reproductions with vibrant colors. These works on posters became more affordable than original art and grew in popularity. This new industry attracted many aspiring artists looking to generate revenue from their work. The commercial success of these posters began the trend of the vintage poster, which has continued into the 21st century. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jADDu8p0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07235S3KM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07235S3KM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07235S3KM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
