window.products.push({"id":878630,"name":"Thanksgiving Turkey with Pumpkin 3 Piece Plush Bathroom Rugs Set-Non Slip Water Absorbent Shower Bath Mats U-Shape Contoured Toilet Mat Lid Cover 20''","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OeRrbogZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Remember last time stepping out of your shower or bath tub on the cold floor, with water running all over the place?Wasn’t a pleasant experience, right? This is all you need to enjoy a pleasant shower and bath experience, this will protect your feet from the cold floor and protect your floor from moisture. This bath mat is not only functional and durable, but also stylish. Highest quality construction and style will automatically change the appearance of your room instantly to a more inviting beautiful room to give you a pleasant experience. THREE PIECE RUG SET – Set includes Contour U-shaped toilet rug 15'' x 18'', small toilet lid 14'' x 18'' and bathroom mat 18'' x 30''. THREE PIECE RUG SET – Set includes Contour U-shaped toilet rug 16'' x 20'', small toilet lid 16'' x 18'' and a bathroom mat 20'' x 31''. COMFORTABLE AND LUXURIOUS - Bath Mat Rug with Rubber Backing Non-slip Prevents Skidding and Shifting. Step right out of the bath or shower onto a cloud! Great for bathroom, vanity, vacation home, master bathroom, kids bathroom, guest suite. Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines. MACHINE WASHABLE - Machine wash in cold water with mild detergent. Do not use chlorine or bleach. Tumble dry on low heat or lay to air dry. Color will not fade. Color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come! NON SLIP & MAXIMUM ABSORBENCY - Mats are backed with rubber backing to prevent shifting and skidding. For best non-slip performance, do not place mat on wet surface. Mats have the ability to absorb a good amount of water so each of your household members may shower the same day and still get to use a dry bathroom rug!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OeRrbogZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vandarllin","source_asin":"B07XKH4CZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XKH4CZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XKH4CZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
