window.products.push({"id":878644,"name":"Vacu Vin Food Vacuum Storage Container - Large, 2.30 Liter, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815RKgizk4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Vacu Vin Large Vacuum Storage Container - 2.30 Liter, White When coffee, tea and various foods are exposed to air, moisture and changes in temperature, they rapidly deteriorate. This then results in a loss of texture, flavour and taste. Vacu Vin recognised this common problem over 20 years ago and consequently manufactured a series of products that were designed to overcome this issue. The 2.30 liter Coffee, Tea and Food Container is part of this collection and is perfect for storing large quantities of the aforementioned items. The device is compatible with all of Vacu Vin's vacuum pumps (not included). The container is constructed from highly durable polycarbonate that is dishwasher safe.  Other products within Vacu Vin's vacuum storage assortment include:  1) A 0.65 liter container that is ideal for storing small volumes of coffee, tea, nuts, seeds etc.  2) A medium canister that offers a greater storage capacity (1.30 liter).  3) A 1.30 and 2.50 liter marinating container (including a vacuum pump) that is perfect for rapidly adding flavor to meat, poultry, fish, vegetables etc. About Vacu Vin Vacu Vin was originally established in 1986 in order to manufacture and distribute the iconic Vacuum Wine Saver. Since then the family-owned company has evolved into a leading brand within the housewares industry, offering an array of barware accessories and kitchen gadgets that are characterised by their quality and innovative functionality. In addition to the Vacuum Wine Saver, Vacu Vin’s product portfolio also includes the award-winning Rapid Ice Coolers and Pineapple Slicers, all of which are now used in over 35 million households and more than 80 countries throughout the world. A specialist in-house design team are constantly striving to add new items to the company’s ever-evolving assortment in order to satisfy the demands of the modern-day consumer. Social Involvement and Fundraising Social involvement has always been at the forefront of Vacu Vin’s philosophy. The company employs over 150 mentally and physically disadvantaged people at their head office production facility in order to assist in the assembly and packaging of almost every product. Vacu Vin also funds the ‘Sharing Success Foundation’, which has helped over 50,000 disabled children and contributed significantly to the development of new facilities in numerous countries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815RKgizk4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacu Vin","source_asin":"B00BCQ4HZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BCQ4HZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BCQ4HZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
