window.products.push({"id":878812,"name":"Bright Zeal 7\" Mosaic Glass Jar Lamp Timer LED String Lights - Decorative Green Mason Jar Lights Indoor Outdoor - Hanging Jar Lights Outdoor - Mosaic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UmUyfs7IL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"MOSAIC GLASS MASON JAR WITH LED STRING LIGHTS CREATES A FAIRY EFFECT, DAY AND NIGHT 1. By day it's a shiny round mason jar (measures 7\" Tall and 3\" in diameter) with green mosaics and star patterns on the exterior.2. At night, LED string lights shine through the mosaic glass, providing a whimsical and sweet feel.3. It is delightful hanging from your porch or using as a tabletop display! GLASS MOSAICS & STAR PATTERNS 1. There are about 160 mosaic glass pieces, and each of them is meticulously hand glued onto the mason jar; adds the perfect touch of vintage charm.2. Green mosaics & black mosaics on the exterior make a splash, giving an instant attention to the jar.3. Mirror-cut mosaics add sparkle and reflect off the surface for a beautiful look you will love.4. Silver star patterns against light yellow background bring a pop of color and a twinkling lighting effect. LET TIME BE YOUR CONVENIENCE 1. Operated by 2 AAA batteries (included).2. With the SET-AND-FORGET timer functioned, the jar light can be left on for 6 hours and then remains off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically.3. Bring a soft luminance to your home at the same time every day without care. FLEXIBLE & EASY DECORATING 1. A hang ring for easy hanging on porches, windows, etc.2. A flat base for easy resting on dressers, mantels, shelves and tables at your home.3. Create a fairy effect indoors and in a covered outdoor area. FAQs 1. The OFF/TIMER/ON switch and battery compartment are on the top of the jar.2. The jar light is not a fully waterproof one. If using outdoors, please place it under a covered area. ATTENTION 1. Remove batteries if the product is not used for a long time.2. Please handle this product with care to avoid being broken down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UmUyfs7IL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B01LZMPRDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZMPRDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZMPRDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
