window.products.push({"id":878816,"name":"Portable Humidifier 400ml Small Cool Mist Personal Desktop Air Moisture Diffuser USB Powered Quiet Operated with Rainbow Colors Night Light Bedroom Hu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RRgWkEzPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Extra 3 Cotton Sticks & Never Leaking】This USB desktop humidifier comes with another 4 replacement cotton sticks that allow the mini humidifier to last for years’ using. With rubber washer inside, it will never leak. No worries about accidentally tipped over. The USB port allows it to be connected with PC, laptop, car charger or any other USB outlet. 【Two Mist Modes & Auto Shut-off】This usb car humidifier has two spray modes. Continuous spray mode for 8 hours and intermittent spray mode for 16 hours. Mist is strong and will not leave traces of water drops, suitable for desk, car, air-conditioned room, office, bedroom. The device will automatically turn off to protect the device within the specified time. 【Small But Strong】The small humidifier is lightweight and portable, you can carry it easily wherever you go, as it works conveniently with the USB port. 7 color-changing LED soft night light and quiet operation (<32dB) making it perfect for sleeping. The non-slip design keeps it's steady. The water window can help to check the water volume conveniently. So it can help you relieve dry air and moisturize skin, keep you relaxed at any time 【Easy One Button Operation】One button for all functions. Press the button once, the cool mist humidifier will continuously spray for 8 hours; press the second time, it will intermittent spray for 16 hours. Click the button for the mist and hold the button for the light. 【Important Notes】1 Please do not add essential oil, perfume or any oil-based liquid in this desk humidifier, otherwise the water droplets will condense on the spray mouth. 2 Before turning on the mini humidifier, make sure the cotton stick is completely socked with water. 3 Be careful not to lose the spring in the cotton holder. We provide 90-DAY MONEY BACK and 12-MONTH WARRANTY via our 24/7 customer service support, so you can place the order now with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RRgWkEzPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"multifun","source_asin":"B0B977TRN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B977TRN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B977TRN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
