window.products.push({"id":878859,"name":"R&M Premium Set of Digital Kitchen Scale, Stainless Steel, 11 lb 5kg, and a Long Probe Instant Read Food Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QYW6piFGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"R&M Premium kitchen scale: High Precision - R&M Premium food scale equipped with 4 high precision sensors to give you accurate weight all the time; 5kg/11lb capacity, 0.01oz/1g division, Perfect for baking, cooking, postage and jewelry. Large Weighing Range - Designed with a newly enlarged weighing platform, this digital kitchen scale weighs up to 5 kg (11 lbs.), which adapts to a variety of items. Stylish Stainless Steel Design - Minimalistic and elegant silver design makes this food scale stylish. Anti-fingerprint design makes it easy to clean and maintain. Multi-Function - Includes an instant and automatic tare function for measurement convenience. Quickly and conveniently convert measurement results at any time between grams (g), ounces (oz), pounds (lbs.) and milliliter (ml) with the press of UNIT button. Low Energy Dissipation - Includes low battery indication and auto-off function after 2 minutes of inactivity, which helps to preserve battery power and efficiency; 2 AAA batteries included. R&M Premium Digital Cooking thermometer: Quick and Accurate Read: LCD display shows accurate temperature results in about 8 seconds. Auto Shutdown : Automatically shuts off after 10 minutes. (Battery Included). Wide Temperature Range : Temperature measurement range of -50ºC (-58°F) to 300°C (572º F). Long Probe : 5.9inch long probe keeps you from burning your hands while measuring. High Quality : Made of high quality 304 stainless steel and stored in the plastic tube, this thermometer is perfect for indoor or outdoor use. (NEVER use the thermometer in a closed oven)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QYW6piFGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R&M Premium","source_asin":"B0714CZVQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0714CZVQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0714CZVQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
