window.products.push({"id":878898,"name":"Kitchen Knife Sharpener - 3-Stage Knife Sharpening Tool Helps Repair, Restore and Polish Blades - 12 Months warranty Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51s5lDY6q8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Discover the Effective Way to Sharpen Knives! Believe it or not, a dull knife is one of the most dangerous objects in your kitchen. When a blade isn’t sharp enough to properly cut food, it can easily slip from your control, nicking your hands or fingers.  Keep cooking fun, safe and healthy with the Knife Sharpener by Thriving life ! Our 3-step systembegins with a diamond sharpening rod slot that gently repairs and straightens damaged blades.You can even use it for ceramic knives! Next, tungsten steel provides coarse sharpening thatrestores the blade to a V-shape before the 3rd slot creates a stunning polish.  Whether you’re a cooking novice or a professional chef, our sharpener is quick and easy to use!Just run the knife through each slot a few times to reveal a razor-sharp blade. With a non-slipbase and an ergonomic handle, you’ll have complete control over the tool. As a thank you forshopping with us, you’ll also receive 12 months warranty!  When you want quality, look no further than Thriving life! Made with solid ABS plastic, oursharpening tool reflects our commitment to excellence. Great for both left and right-handedusers, it’s safe, effective and a must-have for every home. Please note: It's not for use withscissors or serrated knives. Why Choose Our Knife Sharpener? - Innovative 3-step system - Fast and easy to use - Safe and ergonomically designed - Made of ABS plastic - 12-Months warranty Try Today with Our 30-Day Money Back Guarantee! Order This Excellent Kitchen Gadget Now for Triple-Action Restoration!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51s5lDY6q8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thriving Life","source_asin":"B07D8QLQ1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-878898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D8QLQ1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D8QLQ1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
